ied </c><00:00:03.172><c>by </c><00:00:03.175><c>this </c><00:00:03.178><c>function  </c><00:00:03.181><c>that </c><00:00:03.184><c>we </c><00:00:03.187><c>have </c><00:00:03.190><c>already </c><00:00:03.193><c>obtained </c><00:00:03.196><c>carry </c><00:00:03.199><c>out  </c><00:00:03.202><c>the </c><00:00:03.205><c>integration </c><00:00:03.208><c>and </c><00:00:03.211><c>we </c><00:00:03.214><c>will </c><00:00:03.217><c>end </c><00:00:03.220><c>up </c><00:00:03.223><c>with  </c><00:00:03.226><c>a </c><00:00:03.229><c>numerical </c><00:00:03.232><c>value </c><00:00:03.235><c>since </c><00:00:03.238><c>it </c><00:00:03.241><c>is </c><00:00:03.244><c>an </c><00:00:03.247><c>average  </c><00:00:03.250><c>of </c><00:00:03.253><c>what </c><00:00:03.256><c>we </c><00:00:03.259><c>have </c><00:00:03.262><c>here </c><00:00:03.265><c>it's </c><00:00:03.268><c>going </c><00:00:03.271><c>to </c><00:00:03.274><c>end  </c><00:00:03.277><c>up </c><00:00:03.280><c>being </c><00:00:03.283><c>some </c><00:00:03.286><c>number </c><00:00:03.289><c>between </c><00:00:03.292><c>0 </c><00:00:03.295><c>and </c><00:00:03.298><c>1/3  </c><00:00:03.301><c>it's </c><00:00:03.304><c>the </c><00:00:03.307><c>average </c><00:00:03.310><c>of </c><00:00:03.313><c>these </c><00:00:03.316><c>values </c><00:00:03.319><c>and  </c><00:00:03.322><c>closer </c><00:00:03.325><c>to </c><00:00:03.328><c>1/3 </c><00:00:03.331><c>rather </c><00:00:03.334><c>than </c><00:00:03.337><c>to </c><00:00:03.340><c>0 </c><00:00:03.343><c>and </c><00:00:03.346><c>this  </c><00:00:03.349><c>would </c><00:00:03.352><c>complete </c><00:00:03.355><c>the </c><00:00:03.358><c>way </c><00:00:03.361><c>that </c><00:00:03.364><c>the  </c><00:00:03.367><c>performance </c><00:00:03.370><c>of </c><00:00:03.373><c>a </c><00:00:03.376><c>particular </c><00:00:03.379><c>estimator  </c><00:00:03.382><c>gets </c><00:00:03.385><c>evaluated</c>

